OL,3,AGovernment 'looking seriously' at
OL,4,Abanning under-16s from Vinted and eBay
OL,5,
OL,6,FVinted and eBay could be included in
OL,7,Fthe list of platforms set to banned for
OL,8,Funder-16s, the culture secretary has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FLisa Nandy said the government was
OL,12,F"looking seriously" at including the
OL,13,Fretailing websites in the social media
OL,14,Fban "in order to keep children safe".
OL,16,FThe UK's social media ban for those
OL,17,Funder the age of 16 is set to come into
OL,18,Fforce in March next year, with children
OL,19,Fbarred from accessing platforms such as
OL,20,FInstagram, TikTok and Snapchat.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
